flowchart LR
    TEST[GPIO Counter Test] --> SEQ[Counter-specific GPIO Sequence]
    SEQ --> SEQR[GPIO Sequencer]
    SEQR --> DRV[GPIO Driver]
    DRV -->|gpio_out| IF[GPIO Interface]
    IF -->|out0 reset / out1 enable| DUT[Counter16 DUT]
    DUT -->|count 15:0| IF
    IF --> MON[GPIO Monitor]
    MON -->|gpio_item| SB[Counter Scoreboard]

    subgraph UVC[Reusable GPIO UVC]
        SEQR
        DRV
        MON
    end
